#. translators: 1: model name, such as nomic-embed-text, 2: provider name, such as ollama.
#: src/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Posts are read by %1$s (%2$s), which code on this site set up instead of OpenAI. Undergrowth gives it the title and text of each published post without a password, so it can tell which of your posts are about similar things and suggest links between them. Where that code sends them depends on how it was set up, so ask whoever added it. Nothing is sent to OpenAI, even if an OpenAI key is saved. Undergrowth changes a post only when you accept a link in it."
msgstr ""

#: src/settings.php
msgid "With a key, the title and text of each published post without a password are sent to OpenAI, so Undergrowth can tell which of your posts are about similar things and suggest links between them. Nothing is sent while there is no key. Undergrowth changes a post only when you accept a link in it."
msgstr ""

#: src/settings.php
msgid "A draft is read only when you press Scan this draft in the editor: its title and text are sent the same way, once, to suggest links for it, and nothing about it is kept. Private posts, posts behind a password and comments are never sent."
msgstr ""

#: src/settings.php
msgid "With Polylang or WPML active, each post keeps the language it is written in, and only posts in the same language are suggested to each other. A post the plugin gives no language keeps the site’s language."
msgstr ""

#: src/settings.php
msgid "Questions"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings.php
msgid "With a key, Undergrowth asks Claude, through the Anthropic API, to write you an occasional question about your own writing. Each request sends one post’s title, a few sentences quoted from that post and, when the question comes from a reader’s comment, the text of that comment. A question about a gap between your posts quotes one sentence from each of up to three of them instead. Whole posts are never sent. A question about a post you moved to compost is sent back once more, on its own, to check it. Nothing is sent while there is no key. The questions appear only on your Dashboard, never to your readers."
msgstr ""

#: src/settings.php
msgid "Each post that has been read, or that you were asked a question about, has a plain-text file in the folder shown on this page. It holds the post’s stage, its suggestions, your vetoes and the questions you were asked, and nothing written for your readers. The folder’s name ends in random characters made once for this site, so visitors cannot guess its address."
msgstr ""

#: src/settings.php
msgid "Discord"
msgstr ""

#: src/settings.php
msgid "Optional. Undergrowth can post each new link suggestion to a channel in your own Discord server, with Accept and Veto buttons that work like the ones on Posts > Undergrowth. Each message sends Discord the titles of both posts, the suggested sentence, which is in your own words, and links to both posts. Nothing is sent until every Discord field on this page is filled in. Use a private channel: anyone who can read it sees your suggestions, and nothing is ever posted to your readers."
msgstr ""

